<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-78205da4-d10b-49b9-9906-3f883a2b26f6@mhtml.blink" />

<title>HUMAi P — Harare Polytechnic 3D Map</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="manifest" href="https://jmvisorcomp-glitch.github.io/humai-p/manifest.json">
<link rel="icon" href="https://jmvisorcomp-glitch.github.io/humai-p/icon-192.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://jmvisorcomp-glitch.github.io/humai-p/icon-192.png">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0e12">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="HUMAi P">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">



</head>
<body>

<div id="banner">
  <h1>HUMAi P <span style="color:#ff5555;font-weight:400;">· Harare Polytechnic Map</span></h1>
  <span>Drag to look around · pinch or scroll to zoom in/out</span>
</div>
<div id="controlsRow">
  <button class="btn active" id="mapToggle">Base Map: ON</button>
  <button class="btn" id="resetBtn">Reset View</button>
  <button class="btn" id="gpsBtn">Find Me On Campus</button>
</div>
<div id="legend">
  <div><span class="sw" style="background:#e8eef3;"></span>Real map imagery (source)</div>
  <div><span class="sw" style="background:#bfe0ff;"></span>Traced buildings (3D)</div>
  <div><span class="sw" style="background:#3fae6a;"></span>Field / court</div>
</div>
<div id="hint">Drag with your finger or mouse to turn the map · Pinch or scroll to zoom · Two fingers (or right-click drag) to slide the map sideways</div>
<div id="credit">BUILT FROM REAL MAP DATA · HUMAi P<br>ORIGINAL DESIGN BY JERRY MAREYA · JMVISOR</div>
<div id="loading" style="display: none;">Loading scene…</div>

<div id="gpsPanel" class="hidden">
  <div id="gpsPanelInner">
    <button id="gpsClose" aria-label="Close">×</button>
    <h2>Find Me On Campus</h2>
    <div id="gpsStep1" class="gpsStep">
      <p>This uses your phone's location to show a dot for where you are standing, right on the 3D map.</p>
      <p>Before it can do that, you need to line it up with the real world. This takes two quick steps and only needs doing once.</p>
      <p><b>Step 1:</b> Walk to the <b>Main Gate</b> (the red pin on the map). When you are standing there, press the button below.</p>
      <button class="btn gpsAction" id="gpsCalibrate1">I Am At The Main Gate Now</button>
      <p id="gpsMsg1" class="gpsMsg"></p>
      <hr style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); margin:16px 0;">
      <p style="font-size:13px; color:#9fa8b0;">If the button above keeps failing, tap this first — it tells us exactly what your phone says, with no waiting and no walking required:</p>
      <button class="btn gpsAction" id="gpsTestBtn" style="background:#3a3f47; border-color:#3a3f47;">Test My GPS Right Now</button>
      <p id="gpsTestResult" class="gpsMsg"></p>
    </div>
    <div id="gpsStep2" class="gpsStep hidden">
      <p><b>Step 2:</b> Now walk to the <b>Basketball Court</b>. When you are standing there, press the button below.</p>
      <button class="btn gpsAction" id="gpsCalibrate2">I Am At The Basketball Court Now</button>
      <p id="gpsMsg2" class="gpsMsg"></p>
    </div>
    <div id="gpsStep3" class="gpsStep hidden">
      <p>All set. Your location will now show as a blue dot on the map while this page stays open.</p>
      <p id="gpsAccuracyNote" class="gpsMsg"></p>
      <p id="gpsLiveStatus" class="gpsMsg">Waiting for a GPS signal…</p>
      <button class="btn gpsAction" id="gpsRecenterBtn">Center Map On Me</button>
      <button class="btn gpsAction" id="gpsRecalibrate">Start Over</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<canvas id="canvas" width="883" height="1177" style="width: 696px; height: 928px;"></canvas>





</body></html>
